  popupId: level02_intro
  pages:
  - title: Level 2 - Fire hazard
    body: The electrical sockets in this house are faulty. A spark sets the finished
      wooden floor around it on fire.
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Put it out
    body: 'Buy a <b>Fire Extinguisher</b> from the shop, carry it to the fire and
      press <b>Q</b> to spray.


      Burning tiles lose health. If a tile burns
      for too long it breaks and you have to build it again.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Stay safe
    body: Don't walk through the flames, and react early - a small fire is much easier
      to handle than a burning room.
    image: {fileID: 0}
